    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.2,
      505.76,
      295.37,
      599.84
    ],
    "text": "Allotments of land in extent of about 0.0270 Hectare,depicted as lot Nos. 01-03 in the dated 30.01.2017 in thePreliminary Plan No. Gam. 3985 was prepared by the Surveyor-General, situated in the village of Ihala Karagahamuna, in theGrama Niladari Division Ihala Karagahamuna North (248), inthe Minor Division of Adikari Paththuwa, in the DivisionalSecretary's Division of Mahara, in the Gampaha District inWestern Province.",
